sequenceDiagram
  participant You
  participant API as MAEF API
  participant Ledger
  participant Worker
  participant Model
  participant Tools as Sandbox and MCP
  You->>API: start a run (agent, instruction, budget)
  API->>Ledger: pin agent version, reserve tokens
  API-->>You: run id (status admitted)
  Worker->>API: any work for me?
  API->>Ledger: lease the run to this worker
  API-->>Worker: lease (pinned definition, budget)
  Worker->>Tools: start containers
  loop each turn, while budget lasts
    Worker->>Model: messages and tool list
    Model-->>Worker: reply or tool calls
    Worker->>Tools: run tool calls
    Tools-->>Worker: tool results
    Worker->>API: events and heartbeat
    API-->>Worker: keep going, or cancel
  end
  Worker->>API: upload output.md, finish
  API->>Ledger: charge tokens used, free the rest
  Worker->>Tools: remove containers
  You->>API: watch events, fetch result
